WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:00.914
Welcome.

00:00:00.914 --> 00:00:10.281
This video shows Random connect: a way to talk with someone new, anonymously, in a private room that nobody else can read.

00:00:10.281 --> 00:00:16.040
We will cover how it works, how to stay safe, and how to leave at any time.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.472
Here is how it works.

00:00:18.472 --> 00:00:24.679
You are paired with another person who is looking at the same time, usually within seconds.

00:00:24.679 --> 00:00:28.021
You are anonymous, with no names and no accounts.

00:00:28.021 --> 00:00:33.273
Your two browsers agree a secret key between themselves, so we never hold it.

00:00:33.273 --> 00:00:36.410
And either of you can end the chat in one tap.

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:40.162
Open the website, and tap the Random tab.

00:00:40.162 --> 00:00:43.450
You will see a short explanation of how it works.

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:47.395
Choose what you would like to talk about.

00:00:47.395 --> 00:00:54.864
Pick Anyone, or one topic, such as Just chatting, Advice, Games, Music, Movies and shows, Tech or Books.

00:00:54.864 --> 00:00:59.030
We try to pair you with someone who picked the same topic.

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:09.509
Now tick the box to confirm that you are eighteen or older, and that you will be kind, and will not share personal details, photos or money.

00:01:09.509 --> 00:01:12.760
The button stays switched off until you tick it.

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:14.520
Then tap Look for someone.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:16.393
Now we wait.

00:01:16.393 --> 00:01:17.776
Keep this tab open.

00:01:17.776 --> 00:01:23.016
As soon as someone else is looking too, you are connected automatically.

00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:26.072
If you change your mind, tap Stop looking.

00:01:26.072 --> 00:01:32.840
If nobody is found after a few minutes, the search stops, and you can simply try again later.

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:35.110
Pairing is simple.

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:38.710
The person who has waited longest is matched first.

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:43.651
People with the same topic are preferred, and Anyone can match anyone.

00:01:43.651 --> 00:01:49.580
Each pair gets a brand new Temp room, so nothing carries over from any earlier chat.

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:51.866
You are connected.

00:01:51.866 --> 00:01:54.868
At the top, a note shows your safety code.

00:01:54.868 --> 00:01:57.012
Both of you see the same code.

00:01:57.012 --> 00:02:05.660
If you compare it, for example by typing it to each other, you know nobody is secretly sitting between your two browsers.

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:08.090
This is optional, but worth doing.

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:10.389
Now chat as normal.

00:02:10.389 --> 00:02:14.493
Replies, reactions and view once messages all work here too.

00:02:14.493 --> 00:02:17.023
You appear to each other as Stranger.

00:02:17.023 --> 00:02:21.400
Never share your real name, address, photos, passwords or money.

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:24.186
Vanish mode works here too.

00:02:24.186 --> 00:02:27.493
It is the ghost button at the top, off by default.

00:02:27.493 --> 00:02:32.520
Switch it on, and new messages disappear thirty seconds after they are seen.

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:37.761
To stay in control, open Room settings with the sliders button.

00:02:37.761 --> 00:02:43.550
Under Conversation, Clear chat for both erases every message, but keeps the chat open.

00:02:44.550 --> 00:02:47.226
End chat for both finishes the conversation.

00:02:47.226 --> 00:02:52.030
Every message is erased for both of you, and you can then look for someone new.

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:56.280
A confirmation box stops accidental taps.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:58.420
Choose End chat, or Cancel.

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:03.815
If someone makes you uncomfortable, choose Report and end chat.

00:03:03.815 --> 00:03:07.512
The chat ends, and the report is counted anonymously.

00:03:07.512 --> 00:03:16.790
We cannot read conversations, so keep a note of anything serious, and if someone is in danger, contact your local emergency services.

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:18.689
A few rules.

00:03:18.689 --> 00:03:19.514
Do be kind.

00:03:19.514 --> 00:03:21.537
Do compare the safety code.

00:03:21.537 --> 00:03:28.506
Do end or report the chat whenever you feel unsure, and remember that it is still a stranger.

00:03:28.506 --> 00:03:32.029
Never share your name, address or phone number.

00:03:32.029 --> 00:03:34.876
Never send photos, passwords or money.

00:03:34.876 --> 00:03:40.272
Do not open links from a stranger, and do not arrange to meet in person.

00:03:40.272 --> 00:03:42.820
Random connect is for adults only.

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:48.563
When the chat is over, an ended chat is erased at once for both of you.

00:03:48.563 --> 00:03:53.974
If you simply leave, the room is deleted thirty minutes after you have both gone.

00:03:53.974 --> 00:03:56.780
And you can look for someone new any time.

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:59.465
That is Random connect.

00:03:59.465 --> 00:04:03.202
Try it at one two one dot the secret basket dot in.

00:04:03.202 --> 00:04:06.865
Be kind, be careful, and enjoy meeting new people.

00:04:06.865 --> 00:04:08.550
Thank you for watching.
